description.desc:
Generated after <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack: Kindly Rest in Peace]</color> consumes <Term:1000039></Term>, lasting 30s before automatically detonating;
Up to 9 <Term:1000040></Term> can exist at the same time. If this limit is exceeded, the earliest generated <color=#FFFFFF>[Storm's Eye]</color> will automatically detonate;
Detonates when hit by <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack: Forgive Me for Not Seeing You Off]</color>. If fewer than 3 are hit at the same time, 1 Miniature Windstorm is generated at the location of each <color=#FFFFFF>[Storm's Eye]</color>, tracking enemies and dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> for 1s;
If 3 are hit at the same time, 1 Giant Windstorm is generated instead, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> for 1s.
When detonated by any means, a <color=#FFFFFF>[Storm's Eye]</color> releases a blast, dealing 1 instance of <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> to nearby enemies.

When Decibel Rating is at Maximum, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Unleashes a powerful strike at enemies in front in a large area, dealing massive <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
After using this skill, gain 1 <Term:1000039></Term>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.
